creature Pet
  traits
    name is text
    hunger is a number
    happiness is a number
    energy is a number
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
    give self the trait hunger to 0
    give self the trait happiness to 5
    give self the trait energy to 5
  end born

  action play
    when self energy > 0
      give self the trait happiness to self happiness + 2
      give self the trait energy to self energy - 1
      give self the trait hunger to self hunger + 1
      say self name + " played and is now happier! Happiness: " + self happiness + ", Energy: " + self energy
    otherwise
      say self name + " is too tired to play."
    end when
  end action

  action feed
    when self hunger > 0
      give self the trait hunger to self hunger - 2
      give self the trait energy to self energy + 1
      say self name + " ate some food! Hunger is now " + self hunger
    otherwise
      say self name + " is not hungry right now."
    end when
  end action

  action sleep
    give self the trait energy to self energy + 3
    give self the trait hunger to self hunger + 1
    say self name + " took a nap. Energy is restored to " + self energy
  end action
end creature

bring Tamago to life as Pet with ("Tamago")

Tamago does play
Tamago does play
Tamago does feed
Tamago does sleep
Tamago does play
Tamago does feed
